<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container page">
  <h1>How it works</h1>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width:720px">Lionheart connects you with verified factories in China and handles everything in between: sourcing, purchasing, quality inspection, consolidation, freight, customs clearing and delivery. You can buy in two ways.</p>
  <div class="two-ways" style="margin-top:20px">
    <div class="card way way-source"><div class="way-icon"><%- icon('factory', 28) %></div><div><h3>1. Source directly from China</h3>
      <p>You pay factory prices. We order from the supplier on your behalf, inspect the goods at our China warehouse and ship them to you by sea, air or RoRo. Best for bulk orders, projects, machinery and vehicles.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card way way-stock"><div class="way-icon"><%- icon('warehouse', 28) %></div><div><h3>2. Buy from Lionheart stock</h3>
      <p>Products we already hold in our warehouse. You get them faster, with no factory minimum order. Ideal for smaller quantities and urgent needs.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Step by step</h2></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="st"><div class="si"><%- icon('cart') %></div><h3>Choose products</h3><p>Add items to your cart and pick China sourcing or our stock for each one. Or send us a custom request.</p></div>
      <div class="st"><div class="si"><%- icon('clipboard') %></div><h3>Receive a quotation</h3><p>We confirm the latest factory price, shipping, clearing and delivery time, and send you one clear total.</p></div>
      <div class="st"><div class="si"><%- icon('shield') %></div><h3>Accept &amp; pay</h3><p>Accept online and pay by bank transfer. Sourcing orders usually need a deposit before we purchase.</p></div>
      <div class="st"><div class="si"><%- icon('ship') %></div><h3>Track to delivery</h3><p>Follow each stage online: purchasing, inspection, shipping, arrival and delivery.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Why Lionheart</h2></div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="gap:16px">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Verified suppliers</h3><p class="muted mb-0">We work with partner factories we know, across electronics, machinery, heavy equipment, vehicles, furniture and building materials.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Inspection before shipping</h3><p class="muted mb-0">Your goods are checked at our warehouse before loading, so you get what you paid for.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Door-to-door logistics</h3><p class="muted mb-0">Clearing &amp; forwarding is our core business. We handle freight, documents and customs.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="cta-band"><div><h2>Ready to order?</h2><p>Browse the catalog or tell us what you need.</p></div><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href="/products">Browse products</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="/request">Request a product</a></div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
